# QA Fixture Beta - Glob Filter Target
File: oogrep/qa/fixtures/beta.oot

Status: FIXTURE. This document exists only as searchable test data for the oogrep
test suite. It is never compiled and never linked into the binary.

The oogrep glob assertion searches this directory for the token oogrep while
restricting candidates to the *.oot glob. This line is the only match, so the
assertion can prove the glob filter admitted this file and rejected the .oo
fixtures sitting beside it.

## Purpose

Provide a non-openOODA-extension target so the include glob has something to
discriminate on. A search that ignores the glob would match the sibling fixture
pages as well and the count assertion would fail.
